WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<v Sam Osei>The warehouse lease expires in <i>November</i>, not September.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.000
<v Jordan Lee>Then we have four extra weeks to decide whether to renew it.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.000
No speaker was recorded for this line, and it must not disappear.
